OL,3,GNEWSAPolice probe deliberate tenement
OL,4,Afire amid asylum seeker
OL,5,A'disinformation'
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice are investigating a deliberate
OL,8,Ffire at a housing association tenement
OL,9,Fin Glasgow that had previously been
OL,10,Ftargeted by anti-immigration
OL,11,Fprotesters.
OL,13,FThe building in Stonyhurst Street,
OL,14,FPossilpark - which has been derelict
OL,15,Ffor 20 years - had received #3m to be
OL,16,Frenovated as affordable homes.
OL,18,FGlasgow MSP Paul Sweeney claimed there
OL,19,Fwas evidence the blaze was started
OL,20,Fdeliberately on Sunday following online
OL,21,F"disinformation" that the flats would
OL,22,Fbe used for asylum seekers.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
